codex
The existing four frame bodies already share the detector/channel DSP and only differ in dual-vs-mono and uniform-vs-per-lane routing. I’m preserving those loops and arithmetic, moving the stationary admission to the block-entry dispatcher, and making the bodies const-specialized (`Stationary`/`Ramping`); a `Runtime` mode will exist only behind `cfg(test)` and reuse those same bodies as the old-behavior oracle.
apply patch
