         /// Every rendered sample of every block, both planes.

codex
The source tranche now has the shared const-generic dispatch and a private witness covering W8 dual/per-lane, W8 dual/uniform, W8 mono/per-lane, W8 mono/uniform, and scalar dual/uniform. The witness compares bitwise PCM plus the full existing state word set across a 512-frame ramping block (64-sample ramp ends inside it) and the following stationary block; it records route/mode from inside the selected body, with identity assertions before the specialization assertion. I’m preflighting the exact focused selector and capture command next.
apply patch
patch: completed
