codex
The focused run reached the crate and failed at compilation only because this pinned Rust toolchain permits integer/bool/char const generics, not enum const generics. I’m making the bounded dispatch tag an integer const while retaining the typed private observation enum; no DSP or test scope changes are needed. I’ll recapture the corrected focused run under a new raw-output label.
