codex
The post-run audit exposed one witness-strengthening gap before I hand off: the full candidate/oracle state comparison already covered the mono right plane, but it did not explicitly assert that the candidate leaves that plane unchanged from its pre-block baseline. I’m adding that narrow assertion to make the required right-plane non-access evidence load-bearing, then I’ll rerun the same focused selector once.
apply patch
patch: completed
